# Freeze line endings exactly as they are on disk.
#
# The tree is LF-dominant (74 LF vs 6 CRLF at the time of writing), so the
# `eol=crlf` policy that looks natural for a Windows-only project would rewrite
# almost every source file on the next checkout.  `-text` disables Git's
# conversion entirely: whatever bytes are committed are the bytes you get back.
* -text

# Never diff or merge the build artifacts.
*.nes binary
*.bin binary
*.chr binary
*.nsf binary
*.exe binary
